  "description": "JP FAT:The Frey JpFat features a powerful BAFANG M620 1000W mid-drive motor, effortlessly reaching speeds of 28 mph while conquering steep hills and challenging terrains. Equipped with a high-capacity 48V 20Ah battery, it offers long-lasting endurance, making it perfect for extended adventures. The wide Fat tires are specifically designed for optimal performance in desert, snowy, and other complex terrains, ensuring you can ride with confidence in any environment.\nFeatures\n\nQuality Frame and Geometry\nThe Frey Jp Fat features a durable frame that provides strength and stability on challenging terrains. Its optimized geometry ensures balanced handling and comfort, while the low center of gravity enhances stability for effortless rides on steep climbs and rough trails.\nUltra Bafang M620 1000W:\nThe unrestricted 1000W motor delivers exceptional peak performance and 160 Nm of torque, enabling you to conquer the steepest inclines and achieve exhilarating top speeds with ease.\n\nConquer Any Terrain:\nTransform the most challenging and technical landscapes into a breeze with 4.8\" all-terrain \"fat\" tires paired with a buttery smooth KKE inverted front fork and 150mm of rear travel. Whether you're navigating rocky trails, sandy dunes, muddy paths, or snowy surfaces, this setup ensures an effortless ride across all types of rugged terrain.",
